    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks. One more thing—for the concrete and the stone, do you think there's much way we can prevent those surface dulling marks or micro-scratches before they become an eyesore? Like, are there specific coatings or preventative measures that actually work, or is it just an inevitable part of a busy lobby?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
